OL,3,GNEWSA'I married my toyboy during a
OL,4,Athree-day bender'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bride wasted no time getting boozy
OL,7,Fafter marrying her "toyboy" boyfriend
OL,8,Fand heading to a beer festival during
OL,9,Fwhat she described as a "three-day
OL,10,Fbender".
OL,12,FSally Mills and Nick Wall, from Bury St
OL,13,FEdmunds, in Suffolk, tied the knot at a
OL,14,Fregister office on the 29 August before
OL,15,Fgoing to the East Anglian Beer & Cider
OL,16,FFestival in the town's cathedral.
OL,18,FThe 61-year-old and 54-year-old, who
OL,19,Fhave been together for 20 years, drank
OL,20,Fand danced the night away ` including
OL,21,Fan impromptu performance from Sally
OL,22,Fon-stage.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
